@startuml
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
scale max 800 width
skinparam padding 2
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam maxMessageSize 150

title 3.3 — OMCS Compliance Audit: End-to-End Pipeline

actor Operator as O
participant "ContentStudio\nView" as UI
participant "SmartOptimization\nBoard" as SOB
participant "MediaCaption\nManager" as MCM
participant "Compliance\nController" as CC
participant "AIInferenceGateway\nService" as GW
participant "FastAPI\n(omcs_agent)" as FP

== Setup — Stage Caption + Upload Media ==

O -> UI: Approve a caption card (CopywritingOptionCard.onApprove)
UI -> UI: stagedCaption ← approvedCaptions[platform]
UI -> SOB: auditOn = true (SmartOptimizationBoard toggle)
SOB -> MCM: show MediaCaptionManager
O -> MCM: Upload PNG / JPG / WEBP image (≤20 MB)
MCM -> MCM: FileReader reads file as base64 data URL\n→ imageDataUrl

alt no media uploaded
  MCM -> SOB: show AuditEmptyBanner
  note right: Run button disabled until\nmedia is present
end

== Transaction 3.3 — OMCS Compliance Audit ==

O -> SOB: Click "Run Audit"
SOB -> UI: onRunAudit()
UI -> UI: auditRunning = true\nauditProgress animates 0→100 (6 steps)

UI -> CC: POST /api/v1/compliance/omcs-analyze\n{caption, imageUrl, businessProfile, recommendations}

note right of CC
  Validates: caption + imageUrl required.
  Builds snake_case payload.
  Delegates to AIInferenceGatewayService.
  No DB writes — fully stateless.
end note

CC -> GW: analyzeOmcsAgent(payload)
GW -> FP: POST /internal/omcs/analyze\n{caption, image_url, business_profile, recommendations}

note right of FP
  LangGraph omcs_agent (stateless, 3 scoring axes):

  CAS — Content Alignment Score (weight 0.35)
    Profile semantic alignment: business context,
    market localization, tone, psychology vectors.
    7-criterion rubric; each criterion 0–100.

  VAS — Visual Alignment Score (weight 0.45)
    Image evaluated against the creative-direction
    recommendations (shot list, visual guide, platform rules).
    recommendationsPictureScore from rubric total.

  HCS — Heuristic Consistency Score (weight 0.20)
    Caption ↔ image semantic consistency.
    pubmatConsistencyScore; plus consistencyExplanation.

  OMCS = (0.35 × CAS) + (0.45 × VAS) + (0.20 × HCS)
  Pass threshold ≥ 70
end note

FP --> GW: {profile_semantic_score, rubric_evaluation_data,\nrecommendations_picture_score, consistency_explanation,\npubmat_consistency_score, omcs_score, status, feedback}
GW --> CC: raw Map
CC -> CC: mapOmcsAgentResponse() — snake_case → camelCase
CC --> UI: OmcsAuditResultDto\n{profileSemanticScore, rubricEvaluationData,\nrecommendationsPictureScore, consistencyExplanation,\npubmatConsistencyScore, omcsScore, status, feedback}

UI -> UI: auditRunning = false\nauditDone = true\nomcs ← OmcsAuditResultDto
UI -> SOB: render audit result

== Result Rendering ==

SOB -> SOB: ComplianceGauge — circular SVG gauge\n(green ≥80 / gold ≥60 / red <60)
SOB -> SOB: Component score breakdown:\n  Profile Semantic Score × 0.35\n  Recommendations×Picture × 0.45\n  Pubmat Consistency × 0.20
SOB -> SOB: Rubric table — 7 criteria with individual scores

alt status = "Fail"
  SOB -> SOB: Show feedback diagnostic\n(root-cause + suggested corrections)
else status = "Pass"
  SOB -> SOB: Show Pass badge + final OMCS score
end

O -> SOB: Click "Reset Audit"
SOB -> UI: onResetAudit()
UI -> UI: omcs = null, auditDone = false, auditOn = false

@enduml
